# Storehouse (the Mineral silo): holds the stone and the wood the carriers bring ("Mineral silo capacity", "Fuel tank
# capacity"). No light, no field. A 4x6x4 m box (2x2 cells): taller than a house (3 m). Spawned origin 3.0 above the
# ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a two-storey WAREHOUSE, 5.3 m to its ridge - a
# stone plinth (the root), a tall timber hall, a dark roof that hangs over the hall with a ridge on it, a blue door
# and a blue loft hatch in the -Z face (the store's old colour, so it still reads as "the blue one"), a hoist beam
# that sticks out over the hatch, and three crates on the plinth. The child pieces are render-only.
